### Ambil Semua Ruangan
GET http://localhost:5160/api/rooms

### Tambah Ruangan Baru
POST http://localhost:5160/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ruang Gaming Pro",
  "capacity": 5
}

### Tambah Booking Baru
POST http://localhost:5160/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 3,
  "userEmail": "mahasiswa.ambis@pbl.com",
  "startTime": "2026-02-15T08:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-02-15T12:00:00"
}